        "short_quote": "I didn't set out to build a fashion brand. I set out to build a bedtime ritual worth keeping.",
        "body_1": "<p>Néroli began with a simple frustration: sleepwear that looked beautiful in photos but felt like a compromise in real life. Scratchy seams, synthetic fabric, fits that never quite matched the body they were meant for.</p>",
